        "answer": {
          "short": "$17\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "Let $s$ be the base diagonal and $d$ the space diagonal.\n$$\\begin{align*}s^2&=12^2+9^2\\\\s^2&=225\\\\d^2&=s^2+8^2\\\\d^2&=225+64\\\\d^2&=289\\\\d&=17\\text{ cm}\\end{align*}$$",
